{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/i107q5of","slide":5,"text":"If later non-overlapping blocks continue to earn conditional return beyond the unconditional and state-only baselines, a 100-session holding concept is potentially actionable. It would be a medium-term tactical trade, not a swing trade. Actionability still depends on execution timing, drawdown, capital efficiency, turnover, and whether the rule meaningfully differs from always being long.\n\n[Sources]\n- Codex thread 01a0226e-2fa2-7222-a6d9-79ab971ac616 (2026-08-27), operator–Codex huddle immediately following the full-vocabulary atlas closeout.\n[/Sources]"}
