{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/gnmp4jqx","slide":7,"text":"The promotion ladder is behavior → candidate signal → predictive signal → tradeable edge → deployable system. This introductory deck stops at the candidate-design gate. The next technical slice should preserve the original 20-session prior anchor and measure non-overlapping future blocks under the pre-existing filters and baselines.\n\n[Sources]\n- Codex thread 01a0226e-2fa2-7222-a6d9-79ab971ac616 (2026-08-27), operator–Codex huddle immediately following the full-vocabulary atlas closeout.\n- operator_hypothesis_lab/docs/RETURN_GEOMETRY_WIDE_ATLAS_2018_2023.md\n- operator_hypothesis_lab/docs/OWN_ASSET_RETURN_GEOMETRY_WORKFLOW_ROADMAP.md\n[/Sources]"}